#. もしかすると…<CLT 3>彼女<CLT>なら覚えてるかも…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually...<CLT 3>she<CLT> might remember."
msgstr ""

#. だ、誰よ…彼女って…！？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-Who might remember...?"
msgstr ""

#. もう１人の腐川さん…<CLT 3>ジェノサイダー翔<CLT>だよ！
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The other Toko...<CLT 3>Genocide Jack<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. ２人は、知識は共有してるけど、
#. 記憶は共有してないんだったよね？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The two of them share certain kinds of knowledge, but\n"
"their memories aren't linked, right?"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね、記憶を共有していないなら…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I see... If their memories are separate..."
msgstr ""

#. 片方の人格が忘れている事でも、
#. もう片方の人格が、覚えている可能性があるわね。
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...then even if one personality's forgotten, there's a\n"
"chance the other may still have those memories."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どーなんだ、腐川っち！？
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whaddya say, Toko!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あいつに…替われって言うの…ッ！？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Are y-you telling me to swap places...w-with HER!?"
msgstr ""

#. い、嫌よ…ッ！　ぜ、絶対に…！
#. そんなの…あたしのアイデンティティーの崩壊よ…ッ！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"N-No! Absolutely not! That'd be like f-forfeiting my\n"
"entire identity!"
msgstr ""

#. …腐川、お前だけが頼りだ。
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Toko...you're the only one we can rely on now."
msgstr ""

#. …ハクション！
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...Achoo!"
msgstr ""

#. パンパカパーン！！
#. 実は家庭的な殺人鬼でーす！！
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Dun dada duuun! It's me, your friendly neighborhood\n"
"serial killer!"
msgstr ""

#. アイデンティティー…意外と簡単に崩壊しちゃったね…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Boy, she just gave in like it was nothin'..."
msgstr ""

#. 単刀直入に、俺の質問にだけ答えろ。
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm going to ask you a question. And I want to have it\n"
"answered immediately."
msgstr ""

#. あの映像に関して…
#. お前は何か心当たりがあるか…？
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Do you know anything about this video?"
msgstr ""

#. へむ！？　あの映像って！？
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? What video...!?"
msgstr ""

#. あそこのモニターで…流れてる映像です…
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The video that's playing right now..."
msgstr ""

#. アンタ！　誰よ！？
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Who the hell are you!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、黒幕ですけど…
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oh, um...I'm the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. あ、はじめまして！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Oh! Nice to meetcha!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、こちらこそ…
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ah...nice to meet you, too."
msgstr ""

#. いいから、早くモニター見ろって！！
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That's enough! Just look at the stupid screen!"
msgstr ""

#. あいあーい、了解の助！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Aye aye! Roger! You got it, captain!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …どうなの？　見覚えはある？
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well? Does it look familiar?"
msgstr ""

#. 強いて言うなら…
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I don't have all the details, but..."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、知ってますとも！
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Of course it does!"
msgstr ""

#. お、覚えてるんか！？
msgctxt "0029 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Then you remember all the stuff it's showing?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろんですとも！
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Of course I do!"
msgstr "Dĩ nhiên là ta biết chứ!"

#. やっぱり、記憶を失ってなかったんだね？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So you didn't lose your memory, after all..."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、なんで今まで黙ってたのさ！？
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then why didn't you say something earlier!?"
msgstr ""

#. アタシは聞かれた事しか喋らないの！
#. ほら、無口なタイプだし！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I only answer questions when someone bothers to ask\n"
"me! I'm the quiet type, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. …大変だ！　全然、説得力がないよ！
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh my god! She's the worst liar in the world!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より…覚えているなら答えろ…
#. あれは…なんなんだ…？
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"More importantly...if you really do remember, what is\n"
"it?"
msgstr ""

#. あら？　どうしちゃったの白夜様？
#. あの大惨事を忘れちゃったの？
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Huh? What's the matter, Master? Do you really not\n"
"remember The Tragedy?"
msgstr ""

#. …大惨事？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "\"The Tragedy\"...?"
msgstr ""

#. 大変！　本当に忘れちゃったのね！
#. アタシのキスで思い出すかしら！？
msgctxt "0038 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Oh no! You seriously forgot!? Maybe I can help you\n"
"remember...with a kiss!"
msgstr ""

#. いいから答えろ！　外で何が起きたんだ！！
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just answer the question! What happened out there!?"
msgstr ""

#. 起きたというか、今も起きているというか…
msgctxt "0040 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Well, I can't really say if it \"happened\" or if it's\n"
"still happening..."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件<CLT>ですけど。
msgctxt "0041 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But it was the <CLT 3>biggest, most awful, most tragic event\n"
"in human history<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Cái gì...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. なぜ…その言葉がここで出るんだ…？
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Why is that phrase coming up now?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、全部あの事件のせいだし…
msgctxt "0044 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Cuz it's all because of that event."
msgstr ""

#. 何が…？
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What is...?"
msgstr "Cái gì… cơ?"

#. だから…世界がこんな風になっちゃったのが…
msgctxt "0046 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Are you serious? I'm talking about the way the world\n"
"is now."
msgstr ""

#. こんな風…って？
msgctxt "0047 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Is...now?"
msgstr ""

#. こんな風に終わった…だろ！？
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The world's been destroyed, get it!?"
msgstr ""

#. 終わっ…た……？
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Destroyed...?"
msgstr ""

#. く、詳しく話せ…！
#. 知っている事をすべて話すんだ！
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Explain yourself! Tell us everything you know!"
msgstr ""

#. ラジャーよ、ダーリン！
msgctxt "0051 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Copy that, darling!"
msgstr ""

#. えー、人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件が起きたのは、
#. 今から１年前の事でした！
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Okay, so, this big, awful, tragic event—they started\n"
"just calling it The Tragedy—happened about a year ago!"
msgstr ""

#. あれは…殺人鬼も真っ青の事件…
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It was so big and so bad that even this murderous\n"
"fiend went pale at the sight of it."
msgstr ""

#. あれは人災と言うよりは…
msgctxt "0054 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "I guess you could say what happened was man-made..."
msgstr ""

#. もはや、天災と言っていいレベルの事件なのです！
msgctxt "0055 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid ""
"But it was more on the level of a worldwide natural\n"
"disaster!"
msgstr ""

#. まさしく、人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件…
msgctxt "0056 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid ""
"Either way, there's no doubt that it was the biggest,\n"
"most awful, most tragic event in human history."
msgstr ""

#. その結果、世界はあっと言う間に…
msgctxt "0057 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "And as a result, in basically no time flat..."
msgstr ""

#. あんな風になってしまいました。以上です。
msgctxt "0058 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"...the world turned out the way it did. And that's\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. い、以上って！　ちょっと待て！
#. 具体的な事がなんにもわかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0059 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That's all there is to it!? Come on, there wasn't a\n"
"single concrete description in there!"
msgstr ""

#. 具体的にはアタシも知らないの！
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Well it just so happens I don't know any of the\n"
"specifics!"
msgstr ""

#. リアルタイムで見てたのは根暗の方なんで、
#. あっちに聞いてもらった方が…
msgctxt "0061 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Miss Morose saw it all play out in real-time, so why\n"
"don't you ask her?"
msgstr ""

#. あいつに聞いてもわからんから…
#. わざわざ、お前に聞いたんだ…！
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We already did, and she didn't know anything! That's\n"
"why we're asking you!"
msgstr ""

#. 悲劇！　白夜様の期待に応えられなかった！
#. これって悲劇だわ！！
msgctxt "0063 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahh! I couldn't live up to Master's expectations! To\n"
"die, to die...! This is the true tragedy!"
msgstr ""

#. ほらほら、痴話喧嘩はよしなよ。
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, that's enough of your little lover's\n"
"quarrel."
msgstr ""

#. それにさ、何が起きたかなんて、
#. この際、問題じゃないだろ？
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Whatever happened, it doesn't matter at this exact\n"
"point in time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 経過より結果…すべては結果に集約されるんだ。
#. つまり…
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The end justifies the means. Everything serves the\n"
"outcome. In other words..."
msgstr ""

#. 世界は終わったんだ…
#. 重要なのはそれだけだよ。
msgctxt "0067 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The world has ended. That's the important thing."
msgstr ""

#. お、終わる訳ねーべ！！　世界だぞ！？
msgctxt "0068 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "H-How can the world just end!? It's...it's the world!"
msgstr ""

#. 大丈夫だよ、そんなに慌てなくたって…
msgctxt "0069 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Calm down, it's okay. There's no need to panic."
msgstr ""

#. どうせ１００年も経てばみんな死ぬんだし、
#. 世界の終わりなんて、大した事じゃないよ。
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Every living person will be dead in a hundred years\n"
"anyway, so the world ending isn't that big a deal."
msgstr ""

#. くだらん…バカげてる…ッ！
msgctxt "0071 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Oh, come on... Now you're just being ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあさ、バカげた話ついでに、
#. もう１つバカげた話を教えてあげるよ。
msgctxt "0072 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well, as long as we're being ridiculous, I have\n"
"another ridiculous story to tell you."
msgstr ""

#. 十神クンの心の支えでもある、
#. 十神財閥についての話だよ…
msgctxt "0073 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It's the story of the Togami Corporation, which has\n"
"given Byakuya's life all its meaning."
msgstr ""

#. なん…だと！？
msgctxt "0074 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What...? What did you say...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 思った通り、食い付いてくれましたね。
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm glad to see you took the bait."
msgstr ""

#. 疲れたＯＬがケーキバイキングに食い付くように、
#. 食い付いてくれましたね。
msgctxt "0076 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You bit into it like a middle-aged secretary at an\n"
"all-you-can-eat cake buffet."
msgstr ""

#. 十神家は滅びた
msgctxt "0077 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The Togami family fell"
msgstr ""

#. 十神家は滅びた
msgctxt "0078 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The Togami family fell"
msgstr ""

#. 十神家は滅びた
msgctxt "0079 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The Togami family fell"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇねぇ、どう思う？
#. 十神家はどーなっちゃったんだと思う！？
msgctxt "0080 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey! So? What do you think happened to the Togami\n"
"family, hm!?"
msgstr ""
